      "description": "The visual entity 'goat' is mapped onto the textual concept 'screaming goat' through the meme's text. The text 'behind every screaming goat' implies that the goat visually represents a 'screaming goat' — a crude metaphor for loud, chaotic, or shameful behavior. This mapping is spatially reinforced by the text's placement directly over the goat's image, creating a direct visual-textual association where the goat becomes the embodiment of the 'screaming goat' stereotype.",
